WEBVTT

00:00:15.300 --> 00:00:17.030
I don't like the looks of that sky.

00:00:18.900 --> 00:00:20.740
Hey, you alive in there?

00:00:25.240 --> 00:00:31.620
Damn, you sure are a creep, Renji Magatsu.

00:00:32.850 --> 00:00:36.340
Running away again, traitor?

00:00:37.290 --> 00:00:39.380
I won't forgive you.

00:00:40.290 --> 00:00:43.020
Daigo, I...

00:00:43.900 --> 00:00:45.160
I...

00:00:49.330 --> 00:00:51.430
Time to die!

00:00:53.670 --> 00:00:56.540
The perfect world!

00:00:56.540 --> 00:01:03.950
Tsukiakari no shita de yakusoku wo kawashita

00:01:03.950 --> 00:01:06.650
Let's break the spine!
Tsukiakari no shita de yakusoku wo kawashita

00:01:06.650 --> 00:01:11.490
Tsukiakari no shita de yakusoku wo kawashita

00:01:11.490 --> 00:01:15.820
Gozen reiji hoeru you ni sasayaite

00:01:16.360 --> 00:01:21.060
Chinmoku to zattou no naka

00:01:21.800 --> 00:01:26.130
Kuruisou de kowaresou na genjou kai

00:01:26.940 --> 00:01:30.880
Kimi wa sou sa kimi no mama ikite

00:01:30.880 --> 00:01:34.280
That perfect world!
Kimi wa sou sa kimi no mama ikite

00:01:34.780 --> 00:01:39.990
Kamereon janakute

00:01:39.990 --> 00:01:45.120
Kokoro kara kawarou

00:01:45.120 --> 00:01:48.830
Kikoeru yo sono kotoba

00:01:48.830 --> 00:01:55.370
Subete no yoru ga akeru you ni sakebou

00:01:55.370 --> 00:01:59.070
Hageshisa to yasashisa de

00:01:59.070 --> 00:02:10.640
Subete no yoru ga sakeru you ni sakebou

00:02:17.160 --> 00:02:18.620
Tatsuma Hiyu...

00:02:19.690 --> 00:02:23.220
Justice demands that I take your life.

00:02:34.210 --> 00:02:35.610
Aw, c'mon!

00:02:35.610 --> 00:02:37.580
Damn! Not at a time like this...

00:02:39.240 --> 00:02:40.510
What was that?

00:02:41.850 --> 00:02:42.780
The Second Night

00:02:43.480 --> 00:02:44.140
Martial Fist Chapter

00:02:45.650 --> 00:02:47.380
Pu rgatorial Howl

00:02:51.290 --> 00:02:52.980
Give it your best, Sagaya!

00:03:00.100 --> 00:03:02.070
C'mon, what's the matter?

00:03:02.470 --> 00:03:05.130
We're just getting to the catchy part of the song.

00:03:10.140 --> 00:03:14.780
You've sure got a lot of nerve to come
run amok in my hospital.

00:03:14.780 --> 00:03:16.110
Doctor!
Doctor!

00:03:16.110 --> 00:03:17.580
Thanks for keeping an eye on things.

00:03:27.160 --> 00:03:28.420
Spiral Punch?

00:03:28.930 --> 00:03:30.420
Flashing Dragon Kick?!

00:03:30.700 --> 00:03:32.030
????

00:03:42.070 --> 00:03:43.300
Daigo!

00:03:44.110 --> 00:03:45.510
Sakurai?

00:03:46.310 --> 00:03:47.750
What are you doing here?

00:03:47.750 --> 00:03:51.940
I saw this weird smoke.
Well, but before that, this weird guy was...

00:03:53.550 --> 00:03:55.020
What's that?

00:03:55.020 --> 00:03:56.420
He's here.

00:04:02.830 --> 00:04:04.100
Why doesn't he...

00:04:04.100 --> 00:04:05.220
This man...

00:04:11.370 --> 00:04:14.670
This man harbors no malice!

00:04:23.220 --> 00:04:24.740
Over here, this way!

00:04:28.590 --> 00:04:30.520
There's no one here.

00:04:31.290 --> 00:04:34.730
People sure do rotten things though, don't they?

00:04:36.130 --> 00:04:37.250
Yuko...

00:04:38.160 --> 00:04:41.220
Listen, kid, how do I put this?

00:04:41.730 --> 00:04:44.240
The memorial service is already over
and done with, y'know?

00:04:44.240 --> 00:04:46.030
And she's been buried in her grave too.

00:04:47.710 --> 00:04:50.570
Yuko isn't in any grave.

00:04:51.240 --> 00:04:55.650
She was murdered here.
She can't move from this spot.

00:05:03.460 --> 00:05:06.560
Sheesh, I never thought the first person
to come see Crow's reunion

00:05:06.560 --> 00:05:08.320
would fancy herself some kinda killer.

00:05:08.730 --> 00:05:11.660
Still, I guess you are pretty tough though.

00:05:12.360 --> 00:05:15.600
You'll have even more to show next
time you come for me, won't you?

00:05:16.100 --> 00:05:17.670
Tosaka, are you all right?

00:05:17.670 --> 00:05:18.840
Huh?

00:05:18.840 --> 00:05:21.210
Master Ryuzan said to come
to the imperial garden.

00:05:21.210 --> 00:05:22.570
What happened?

00:05:23.810 --> 00:05:25.740
He came at me from out of the blue.

00:05:26.040 --> 00:05:28.240
Could the same thing be happening to
the others right now too?

00:05:29.410 --> 00:05:32.980
I'll protect you, Sakurai.

00:05:35.720 --> 00:05:39.050
Daigo, you're hurt.

00:05:45.030 --> 00:05:49.160
I'm sorry you had to get wrapped up in this too.

00:05:49.370 --> 00:05:52.530
We've both been wrapped up in this.
We're partners in crime.

00:05:55.410 --> 00:05:57.380
I'm more worried about the others right now.

00:05:57.540 --> 00:05:59.170
We've gotta go warn them.

00:06:01.880 --> 00:06:06.440
Honestly, aren't we all a bit old to be
playing hide and seek, Yuu?

00:06:06.690 --> 00:06:09.250
Okay, I'll count ten.

00:06:10.360 --> 00:06:12.720
One...

00:06:12.720 --> 00:06:13.190
Amazing, I've never seen anything like it.

00:06:13.190 --> 00:06:15.330
Two...
Amazing, I've never seen anything like it.

00:06:15.330 --> 00:06:15.860
Amazing, I've never seen anything like it.

00:06:15.860 --> 00:06:17.000
Three...

00:06:17.000 --> 00:06:17.760
Three...
Daigo, is he also one of the
Martial Fist or whatever?

00:06:17.760 --> 00:06:18.830
Daigo, is he also one of the
Martial Fist or whatever?

00:06:18.830 --> 00:06:20.300
Four...
Daigo, is he also one of the
Martial Fist or whatever?

00:06:21.100 --> 00:06:22.960
Five...

00:06:23.470 --> 00:06:25.900
Six...

00:06:25.900 --> 00:06:26.270
What's wrong? This isn't like you!

00:06:26.270 --> 00:06:28.170
Seven...
What's wrong? This isn't like you!

00:06:28.770 --> 00:06:29.070
It's no use. I can't fight him.

00:06:29.070 --> 00:06:30.740
Eight...
It's no use. I can't fight him.

00:06:30.740 --> 00:06:32.040
It's no use. I can't fight him.

00:06:32.040 --> 00:06:33.210
Nine...
It's no use. I can't fight him.

00:06:33.210 --> 00:06:35.010
What are you talking about?!

00:06:35.010 --> 00:06:36.380
Ten...

00:06:36.380 --> 00:06:37.580
He's...

00:06:37.580 --> 00:06:39.910
Found you.

00:06:43.790 --> 00:06:48.030
Hey, there! At least answer, will you?

00:06:48.030 --> 00:06:50.690
Does this mean you don't even
want to talk to me?

00:06:51.030 --> 00:06:52.390
Daigo...

00:06:54.270 --> 00:06:55.990
Sa..Sakurai!

00:06:57.870 --> 00:06:59.060
Just watch.

00:07:00.810 --> 00:07:02.640
Don't, Sakurai!

00:07:02.840 --> 00:07:05.340
I notice you've got a girl with you
and look at who it is:

00:07:05.340 --> 00:07:08.710
Magami High's Komaki Sakurai.

00:07:08.710 --> 00:07:11.480
I didn't know you two were like that.

00:07:12.150 --> 00:07:16.320
I don't know who you are, but if you want
to fight, it's me you're fighting!

00:07:16.320 --> 00:07:18.980
No, Sakurai, don't do it! Run!

00:07:20.990 --> 00:07:22.130
Daigo!

00:07:22.130 --> 00:07:26.100
Hey, she made the offer.
You just sit quietly and watch.

00:07:26.100 --> 00:07:28.030
Why you!

00:07:29.200 --> 00:07:31.030
Go!

00:07:36.310 --> 00:07:38.080
Sakurai!

00:07:38.080 --> 00:07:41.680
Can't say I dislike a feisty woman.

00:07:41.680 --> 00:07:44.280
Stop it, Magatsu! Cut it out!

00:07:44.280 --> 00:07:46.180
Stop!

00:07:46.180 --> 00:07:50.620
Daigo, l...

00:07:52.720 --> 00:07:56.420
Now then, what do you say, Daigo?

00:07:56.800 --> 00:08:00.820
It won't be much longer before she's
been completely turned to stone.

00:08:04.300 --> 00:08:09.260
If you want to save her, then fight me, Daigo.

00:08:10.010 --> 00:08:13.270
You've brought this on yourself.

00:08:13.580 --> 00:08:15.070
Wouldn't you say?

00:08:30.700 --> 00:08:32.190
Sakurai...

00:08:55.120 --> 00:08:56.640
Kyouichi?

00:09:15.010 --> 00:09:16.240
Everyone's okay, so don't worry!
Aoi

00:09:16.240 --> 00:09:17.610
Everyone's okay, so don't worry!
Aoi
Misato...

00:09:17.610 --> 00:09:17.730
Everyone's okay, so don't worry!
Aoi

00:09:18.310 --> 00:09:22.210
Tohno, maybe you've heard something.

00:09:22.750 --> 00:09:25.250
Misato and the others were all absent.

00:09:25.250 --> 00:09:29.780
Um, well, you see, the lntelligence
Office is closed for today.

00:09:30.050 --> 00:09:32.750
I heard they ate too much ramen
and are laid up in bed!

00:09:35.230 --> 00:09:36.590
To your friend?

00:09:36.590 --> 00:09:39.120
Yeah, I lied to her.

00:09:40.170 --> 00:09:42.730
They supposedly called themselves
the "Martial Fist" or something.

00:09:42.730 --> 00:09:44.220
Who the heck is that?

00:09:45.940 --> 00:09:47.440
Sorry I'm late.

00:09:47.440 --> 00:09:48.410
Hina!

00:09:48.410 --> 00:09:50.140
Hiyu!

00:09:50.140 --> 00:09:52.580
Thank goodness! You're okay, right?

00:09:52.980 --> 00:09:55.100
Where are lords Daigo and Houraiji?

00:09:55.710 --> 00:09:57.980
No one's heard from them yet.

00:09:58.320 --> 00:10:00.380
I haven't been able to get a
hold of Komaki either.

00:10:03.050 --> 00:10:04.780
So, what do we do, young master?

00:10:05.190 --> 00:10:08.520
We can't plan much of a strategy
unless everyone's here.

00:10:09.660 --> 00:10:11.860
Wait, one more is coming.

00:10:12.100 --> 00:10:13.100
Huh?

00:10:13.100 --> 00:10:16.660
Good grief, I finally get here,

00:10:17.900 --> 00:10:20.210
and it's a bunch of creepy-ass city kids.

00:10:20.210 --> 00:10:21.740
Who the fuck are you, buddy?!

00:10:21.740 --> 00:10:24.170
Stop! This man is our ally.

00:10:24.780 --> 00:10:26.000
What?

00:10:27.710 --> 00:10:31.240
Don't get all hostile with me, you little shits!

00:10:33.080 --> 00:10:35.550
So, did you find anything out?

00:10:35.550 --> 00:10:38.850
Well, he hasn't uttered so much as a peep.

00:10:39.320 --> 00:10:41.490
C'mon now, won't you talk to me?

00:10:41.760 --> 00:10:43.820
Tell me what happened.

00:10:46.560 --> 00:10:48.760
Hm? What's this?

00:10:49.270 --> 00:10:51.570
Th..This is... Big Mama!

00:10:51.570 --> 00:10:52.640
What is it?

00:10:52.640 --> 00:10:54.870
This is Kyochee's...

00:10:55.710 --> 00:10:57.140
What's going on here?

00:10:57.140 --> 00:10:59.880
Hey, you bastard! What are you trying to hide?!

00:10:59.880 --> 00:11:02.650
There's no way Kyochee would have
just left this lying around!

00:11:02.650 --> 00:11:04.420
Stop it, Angie.

00:11:04.420 --> 00:11:05.580
But...

00:11:05.750 --> 00:11:06.750
Martial Fist...

00:11:06.750 --> 00:11:08.950
Huh? "Martial Fist"?

00:11:10.090 --> 00:11:11.780
Martial Fist, you say?

00:11:12.560 --> 00:11:15.460
What? Do you know what that is, Big Mama?

00:11:16.730 --> 00:11:18.820
I am Doshin Narasaki.

00:11:19.060 --> 00:11:22.290
Ryuzan's appointed me your new leader.

00:11:22.600 --> 00:11:23.740
Now come with me.

00:11:23.740 --> 00:11:24.840
Wait a minute!

00:11:24.840 --> 00:11:27.370
Some of our companions haven't shown up yet!

00:11:27.370 --> 00:11:31.440
They've already gone on ahead of us.
Don't worry.

00:11:31.440 --> 00:11:34.970
Really? Oh, that's good.

00:11:48.160 --> 00:11:50.530
I don't remember any place like
this in the imperial garden.

00:11:50.530 --> 00:11:51.630
Big sister...

00:11:51.630 --> 00:11:53.390
Are they raising pandas or something?

00:11:56.630 --> 00:11:59.160
Hey! I've brought 'em.

00:12:00.610 --> 00:12:03.100
Well done, Doshin.

00:12:03.440 --> 00:12:05.140
Have you recovered from your injuries?

00:12:05.140 --> 00:12:09.380
Ah, get outta her, makin' me push myself
when I'm still recuperating...

00:12:10.920 --> 00:12:13.380
Um, where's Komaki?

00:12:13.380 --> 00:12:15.410
And where the heck are the bodybuilder
and the guy with the wood sword?

00:12:17.420 --> 00:12:18.720
Hiyu...

00:12:19.220 --> 00:12:20.430
Sorry about that.

00:12:20.430 --> 00:12:21.430
No!

00:12:21.430 --> 00:12:23.020
You deceived us!

00:12:23.700 --> 00:12:26.930
This place is in Tokyo and yet it is not.

00:12:27.470 --> 00:12:30.660
It is shut out from the world by a spiritual barrier.

00:12:30.940 --> 00:12:33.460
I will not allow you to leave now!

00:12:33.810 --> 00:12:36.740
Damn! They were stringing us
along the whole time!

00:12:36.940 --> 00:12:40.110
Let us go! Let us go help Komaki and the others!

00:12:40.110 --> 00:12:41.770
Silence!

00:12:42.580 --> 00:12:46.740
If you simply must go out, then you may
do so after defeating me first.

00:12:47.990 --> 00:12:51.720
I cannot allow more lives to be sacrificed.

00:12:52.760 --> 00:12:54.450
Please understand.

00:13:00.630 --> 00:13:03.690
Please explain what is going on now.

00:13:05.640 --> 00:13:09.200
As for the string of bizarre murders
occurring throughout the city...

00:13:09.970 --> 00:13:15.210
The victims were all part those known as the
Twenty-Eight Constellations of Kanto.

00:13:15.580 --> 00:13:19.080
Just like the Kisaragi and the Oribe,

00:13:19.080 --> 00:13:22.850
they are Guardians, who have protected
Tokyo throughout the ages.

00:13:23.290 --> 00:13:27.630
But the Oribe and myself aside,
the others aren't...

00:13:27.630 --> 00:13:29.130
Correct.

00:13:29.130 --> 00:13:32.430
We have not yet determined
our enemies' motives.

00:13:32.700 --> 00:13:36.830
Master, the people who attacked us all
had this name in common...

00:13:37.670 --> 00:13:43.110
The Martial Fist... Angie, you've at least heard
stories about them, haven't you?

00:13:43.110 --> 00:13:45.980
You don't mean that group of assassins, do you?

00:13:45.980 --> 00:13:48.110
I thought they were just an urban legend though.

00:13:48.110 --> 00:13:50.910
Legend? Oh, please.

00:13:51.180 --> 00:13:55.850
The Martial Fist is a shadowy organization
whose business is murder.

00:13:56.390 --> 00:14:01.260
They gather people with heightened
senses or physical abilities

00:14:01.260 --> 00:14:05.460
and thoroughly train them to be assassins.

00:14:06.130 --> 00:14:10.070
I've heard that even the police turn a
blind eye to the Martial Fist,

00:14:10.070 --> 00:14:12.700
since the organization supposedly has
connections with the top brass.

00:14:13.370 --> 00:14:16.610
It is not unusual to find people
among their ranks

00:14:16.610 --> 00:14:20.140
who, like you, have awakened
to the power they possess.

00:14:20.140 --> 00:14:22.710
Then these new opponents...

00:14:22.710 --> 00:14:25.620
Possess power, just like we do.

00:14:25.620 --> 00:14:28.350
Correct, however...

00:14:28.350 --> 00:14:31.460
The Martial Fist's goal is the
eradication of evil.

00:14:31.460 --> 00:14:32.820
I was under the impression that

00:14:32.820 --> 00:14:36.590
they only target those who commit evil deeds
and escape the eyes of the law.

00:14:36.590 --> 00:14:38.900
Was the Boss really that bad a guy?

00:14:38.900 --> 00:14:42.330
Moron! My Kyochee is a good boy!

00:14:42.600 --> 00:14:45.590
There's no reason he should
be targeted by any killer!

00:14:46.100 --> 00:14:47.590
Kyoichi's...

00:14:48.440 --> 00:14:50.910
What happened to him? Tell me!

00:14:50.910 --> 00:14:53.780
Um, well...

00:14:55.180 --> 00:14:56.680
Why did they attack us?

00:14:56.680 --> 00:14:58.280
You can forget about the whys.

00:14:58.280 --> 00:15:00.220
If they're our enemies, we're gonna
get 'em, simple as that.

00:15:00.220 --> 00:15:03.750
That's right, we beat them! I'm not afraid!

00:15:03.750 --> 00:15:05.480
Give it a rest.

00:15:05.790 --> 00:15:07.850
Don't go throwing your lives away.

00:15:08.290 --> 00:15:10.690
The Martial Fist aren't your only enemies.

00:15:12.260 --> 00:15:13.560
His technique...

00:15:15.100 --> 00:15:16.590
Could it be?

00:15:18.740 --> 00:15:20.070
But...

00:15:20.640 --> 00:15:22.370
By the way, Doshin...

00:15:23.470 --> 00:15:25.410
Is the other one safe?

00:15:25.910 --> 00:15:28.500
Yeah, no need to worry.

00:15:28.850 --> 00:15:30.400
Not a problem at all.

00:15:36.250 --> 00:15:37.690
That man...

00:15:38.360 --> 00:15:44.160
What's the matter? This isn't like you at all,
to be so down after losing a kill.

00:15:44.160 --> 00:15:45.230
Quiet.

00:15:45.230 --> 00:15:46.750
Oh, how cold.

00:15:47.130 --> 00:15:49.070
Magatsu isn't back yet?

00:15:49.700 --> 00:15:50.860
Director!

00:15:51.070 --> 00:15:52.670
How did things go?

00:15:52.670 --> 00:15:54.070
Fabulously.

00:15:54.070 --> 00:15:57.210
I was interrupted, my sincere apologies.

00:15:57.210 --> 00:15:59.510
Your overconfidence got the best of you, did it?

00:16:00.110 --> 00:16:03.310
It seems the others have all been defeated
by their intended victims.

00:16:04.080 --> 00:16:05.750
What about your target?

00:16:05.750 --> 00:16:09.690
I believe he is still hiding
somewhere within the city.

00:16:11.960 --> 00:16:18.190
Through the words of passersby,
divine for us now, oh spirits...

00:16:19.660 --> 00:16:22.290
A doubtful mind disrupts one's technique.

00:16:23.400 --> 00:16:28.340
Trust me, destroy those who commit evil deeds.

00:16:28.940 --> 00:16:30.200
Is that understood?

00:16:30.810 --> 00:16:32.110
Yes, sir.

00:16:34.280 --> 00:16:36.580
So, what should we do?

00:16:36.580 --> 00:16:38.910
Is staying here our only choice?

00:16:39.380 --> 00:16:43.480
For the present, we are conducting a
survey of the surviving Guardians.

00:16:44.020 --> 00:16:46.390
Awaiting the proper moment is
also part of our strategy.

00:16:46.560 --> 00:16:47.860
Damn it...

00:16:47.860 --> 00:16:50.760
We don't even know if the others are safe or not!

00:16:50.760 --> 00:16:53.560
I'm certain that Kyouichi will be back,

00:16:54.570 --> 00:16:56.590
as well as Daigo and Sakurai.

00:16:57.130 --> 00:16:58.470
Hiyu?

00:16:58.700 --> 00:17:00.230
Do you sense something?

00:17:00.440 --> 00:17:03.310
I'm sorry, that's not what I meant.

00:17:03.310 --> 00:17:06.840
Hey, spare me the half-hearted
consolation, will ya?

00:17:06.840 --> 00:17:10.480
Jeez, friggin' kids. Ah, well,
guess I got no choice.

00:17:10.480 --> 00:17:12.220
Doshin, you don't mean to...

00:17:12.220 --> 00:17:14.550
I'm in line to die before them anyway.

00:17:15.220 --> 00:17:18.250
You won't have any problems if I go, will you?

00:17:18.960 --> 00:17:20.510
Besides...

00:17:23.430 --> 00:17:26.890
I don't want to abandon anyone.

00:17:28.470 --> 00:17:29.730
I'm goin' too!

00:17:29.730 --> 00:17:31.200
Don't try to stop me.

00:17:31.200 --> 00:17:33.040
Lightning Boy, eh?

00:17:33.040 --> 00:17:34.710
Well, just stay outta my way, kid.

00:17:34.710 --> 00:17:38.280
This is my first time jammin'
with an old geezer,

00:17:38.280 --> 00:17:40.680
but I guess I'm down with the oldies too.

00:17:40.680 --> 00:17:43.240
Heh, I like your attitude.

00:17:44.120 --> 00:17:46.550
By the way, Tatsuma Hiyu...

00:17:46.850 --> 00:17:49.920
You protect everyone here. Got it?

00:17:49.920 --> 00:17:50.890
Huh?

00:17:51.420 --> 00:17:52.980
Yes, sir.

00:17:55.730 --> 00:17:56.430
Let's do it!

00:17:56.430 --> 00:17:56.830
R.. Right!
Let's do it!

00:17:56.830 --> 00:17:58.130
R..Right!

00:17:58.130 --> 00:18:02.460
You gotta be shitting me!

00:18:13.880 --> 00:18:14.880
Who...

00:18:14.880 --> 00:18:16.110
Huh?

00:18:28.290 --> 00:18:29.760
Hiyu?!

00:18:29.760 --> 00:18:31.850
You're late.

00:18:33.260 --> 00:18:35.300
I'm surprised.

00:18:35.300 --> 00:18:39.100
I wouldn't have thought a guy like
you would fall in love with a girl.

00:18:41.640 --> 00:18:45.340
I never thought you'd have
such an ordinary heart.

00:18:46.380 --> 00:18:51.210
So what, you're not going to Hell with me?

00:18:51.980 --> 00:18:55.350
Well, Yuu?

00:19:05.830 --> 00:19:09.960
I'm thinkin' about killing my old man.

00:19:10.200 --> 00:19:11.570
Magatsu?!

00:19:11.870 --> 00:19:19.040
Say, Yuu, one of these days let's ditch this
town and head somewhere far away.

00:19:19.410 --> 00:19:20.930
Far away, huh?

00:19:21.550 --> 00:19:24.380
Might be to Hell if you're gonna kill your parent.

00:19:24.380 --> 00:19:28.150
Hell, huh? That might not be so bad either.

00:19:30.650 --> 00:19:32.090
Magatsu!

00:19:32.890 --> 00:19:35.360
Yuu, l...

00:19:40.430 --> 00:19:43.090
Traitor!

00:19:43.530 --> 00:19:50.130
You know, I thought you were my
buddy through thick and thin.

00:19:51.910 --> 00:19:56.040
Why?! Why did you betray me?!

00:19:56.850 --> 00:20:00.680
You were all I had!

00:20:04.690 --> 00:20:09.180
Ah, doesn't matter, I get it now.

00:20:09.930 --> 00:20:12.560
You see, she told me.

00:20:13.330 --> 00:20:17.890
You didn't care what happened to me, did you?

00:20:19.770 --> 00:20:23.870
You just wanted to see someone else kill his dad

00:20:23.870 --> 00:20:25.900
instead of you having to do it yourself, that's all.

00:20:26.540 --> 00:20:30.780
That was how you wanted to fulfill
your own dark desires.

00:20:31.380 --> 00:20:33.040
I'm right, aren't l?

00:20:35.350 --> 00:20:37.550
I despise you.

00:20:38.020 --> 00:20:42.250
I want to make you suffer before I kill you.

00:20:47.600 --> 00:20:50.530
What have we here?

00:20:50.530 --> 00:20:53.630
You gonna get on your knees
and apologize to me?

00:20:54.070 --> 00:20:56.440
Is that how much this woman means to you?

00:20:56.540 --> 00:21:00.480
Gee, that's too bad. You can't
love a rock now, can you?

00:21:13.890 --> 00:21:16.860
Daigo, y..you...

00:21:46.890 --> 00:21:48.420
Daigo?

00:21:49.060 --> 00:21:51.120
You think everyone's okay?

00:21:51.330 --> 00:21:52.590
Doctor?

00:21:52.860 --> 00:21:55.630
Those guys won't be defeated so easily.

00:21:57.000 --> 00:21:59.870
They've got a couple of good
men on their side too.

00:22:00.700 --> 00:22:02.610
Well, a couple old geezers, that is.

00:22:02.610 --> 00:22:05.200
Wh..What happened then?

00:22:06.540 --> 00:22:09.450
It was dark, and I couldn't see his face too well.

00:22:09.450 --> 00:22:12.310
So, the weird, old guy took him away, right?

00:22:12.550 --> 00:22:16.650
He mumbled, "Good grief, talk about a
stubborn son of a bitch", or something.

00:22:17.020 --> 00:22:21.430
So, Kyochee was still alive at least.

00:22:21.430 --> 00:22:23.390
Wait a minute!

00:22:23.390 --> 00:22:26.760
So, then where is Kyouichi now?!

00:22:41.850 --> 00:22:46.950
Kanashige ni sukoshi utsumuite

00:22:46.950 --> 00:22:51.650
Yatto kimi wa tsubuyaita

00:22:52.060 --> 00:23:01.230
Kasuka ni kikoeta no wa seiippai no sayonara

00:23:03.170 --> 00:23:08.170
Fushizen na chinmoku no naka

00:23:08.170 --> 00:23:12.440
Hibiku bokura no kodou

00:23:12.440 --> 00:23:16.810
Mata aeru meguriaou yo

00:23:16.810 --> 00:23:22.620
Sorezore no asu wo sagashi ni deyou yo

00:23:22.620 --> 00:23:27.120
Setsunasa ni yasashisa kureta

00:23:27.120 --> 00:23:31.560
Ima kimi ni arigatou

00:23:32.730 --> 00:23:37.370
Marude sou kono hanabira ga

00:23:37.370 --> 00:23:43.010
Tabidachi wo shukufuku shiteru you sa

00:23:43.010 --> 00:23:47.380
Sabishisa wo tsutsunde kureta

00:23:47.380 --> 00:23:51.840
Nukumori wasurenai

00:23:52.650 --> 00:23:57.750
Ima kimi ni arigatou

